. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Jan 22, 2021 it closed at $38.03, its first close above the base high of $36.18. Volume that day was 1.1M shares, 1.28x the prior 10-day average of 867K. It didn't hold. By Jan 29, 2021 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $33.40.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}